ãThe Deciding Battle of the Strongest Youth, Begins!ã

7274
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:59,470
There are three men in the Gremory family.

7275
00:01:59,470 --> 00:02:02,810
Since President cares deeply for her family,

7276
00:02:02,810 --> 00:02:07,440
I've always thought her differences
in treatment between us was weird.

7277
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:12,020
To begin with, President is the type
of person who values romance.

7278
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:15,530
So, no matter how much she
loves her family members,

7279
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:19,660
would she normally initiate sex with them?

7280
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:21,910
No! I don't think she would.

7281
00:02:21,910 --> 00:02:26,710
So, taking that into consideration,
her attitude towards me...

7282
00:02:26,710 --> 00:02:30,130
Is the president in love with me?

7283
00:02:30,130 --> 00:02:32,090
No, no! No way!

7284
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:33,380
President is my master!

7285
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:37,670
I'm her servant! I'm a devil family
member and Rias Gremory's Pawn!

7286
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:40,470
But...

7287
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:44,350
If President loves me,

7288
00:02:44,350 --> 00:02:46,770
I love President, too.

7289
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:52,190
Of course, I love her as my master.
But I love her as a woman, too!

7290
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:56,820
I've seen many sides of the
President this last half a year.

7291
00:02:56,820 --> 00:02:58,740
Her brilliance.

7292
00:02:58,740 --> 00:03:00,740
Her nobility.

7293
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:03,030
Her glamour.

7294
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:05,040
Her kindness.

7295
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:07,660
Her smooth skin.

7296
00:03:07,660 --> 00:03:10,290
Her spoiled side.

7297
00:03:10,290 --> 00:03:14,460
She's a big sister, yet makes
you feel like she's your same age.

7298
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:19,090
Because of that, I began to
see her as a normal girl, too...

7299
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,970
She is truly the ideal woman.

7300
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:27,600
I want to go beyond our master and servant
relationship and date as man and woman!

7301
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:30,980
I want to confess my love to her.

7302
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:37,320
But, is President really in love with me?

7303
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:41,110
If I'm wrong, our relationship will end.

7304
00:03:41,110 --> 00:03:43,200
I don't want that to happen.

7305
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,950
But, that attitude is definitely...

7306
00:03:44,950 --> 00:03:48,910
Dammit! A girl's heart is so
complicated and confusing!

7307
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,250
That may be true in the eyes of a man.

7308
00:03:53,250 --> 00:03:54,290
Huh?

7309
00:03:59,550 --> 00:04:04,390
Ouch. D-Did you hear what I was saying?

7310
00:04:04,390 --> 00:04:05,720
Clearly.

7311
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:12,520
Have I really not been thinking
of President's feelings at all?

7312
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:14,860
Yes, you haven't.

7313
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:22,780
You also have not been thinking about me,
Asia, Xenovia, and Koneko here.

7314
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:30,330
But, perhaps, we haven't really tried
to understand you either, Issei.

7315
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:33,620
Understand me?

7316
00:04:35,750 --> 00:04:38,590
Yes, that's right.

7317
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:41,550
Huh? Um, Akeno?!

7318
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:43,840
We realized something.

7319
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,970
Rias is important to us.

7320
00:04:45,970 --> 00:04:50,810
But, right now, we must heal you first, Issei.

7321
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:57,980
We shall suck out the power of your dragon here.

7322
00:05:02,150 --> 00:05:04,860
Issei, please hold me.

7323
00:05:04,860 --> 00:05:06,700
Huh?!

7324
00:05:06,700 --> 00:05:08,870
I'm telling you to hug me.

7325
00:05:08,870 --> 00:05:12,370
I'm going to perform healing
sage arts today, too.

7326
00:05:13,540 --> 00:05:15,250
Th-That place is!

7327
00:05:15,250 --> 00:05:17,830
There... There...

7328
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:21,130
Akeno? Koneko?

7329
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:29,510
I shall join as well.

7330
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:31,890
Asia...

7331
00:05:31,890 --> 00:05:37,770
Sometimes, when you look at us,
your eyes look very scared.

7332
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:42,650
I didn't understand why at first,
but now I think I do.

7333
00:05:42,650 --> 00:05:47,740
I think only the people who knew
what happened would realize it.

7334
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:53,250
Isn't Lady Raynare still
lingering deep inside your heart?

7335
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:57,580
Would you die for me?

7336
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:00,460
Oh, yeah! It was a date fit for a king.

7337
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:02,750
And as a result, it was extraordinarily dull.

7338
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:07,760
Don't go using my name so lightly,
you rotten punk!

7339
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:11,930
Spare me, Issei.

7340
00:06:11,930 --> 00:06:15,350
This devil is trying to kill me!

7341
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:22,690
I love you! I love you dearly!
So, let's defeat this devil together!

7342
00:06:22,690 --> 00:06:25,530
She was my first girlfriend.

7343
00:06:25,530 --> 00:06:28,070
But, she was an enemy.

7344
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:30,280
She killed me.

7345
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,990
And she killed Asia.

7346
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:35,500
I got so mad and punched her.

7347
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:39,460
In the end, she even begged for her life.

7348
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:40,960
But...

7349
00:06:40,960 --> 00:06:45,340
...I don't want to experience
something like that ever again.

7350
00:06:48,050 --> 00:06:53,850
Even now, I'm scared of something
like that happening again.

7351
00:06:53,850 --> 00:07:00,350
I love you, Issei. I wish to be with you forever!

7352
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:01,810
Asia.

7353
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:06,860
I admire you. I yearn for you.
You are the most dependable man I know.

7354
00:07:06,860 --> 00:07:12,320
I always wish to be with you
from the bottom of my heart.

7355
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:18,870
And, it is impossible for big sister
Rias to ever come to hate you!

7356
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:23,500
You fight for big sister Rias'
sake more than anyone else.

7357
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:27,300
This is something everyone
understands very well.

7358
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:31,890
So please have courage. You will be fine, Issei.

7359
00:07:31,890 --> 00:07:35,640
A hard-working person like you will
surely be able to overcome this.

7360
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:45,020
I love you as well, Issei.

7361
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:46,730
Me, too.

7362
00:07:46,730 --> 00:07:50,400
I don't think you have to worry
about that fallen angel anymore.

7363
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,610
Koneko...

7364
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:53,070
That's right.

7365
00:07:53,070 --> 00:07:57,660
As a fallen angel myself, I will be
sure to make you happy, Issei.

7366
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,870
So have more confidence, Issei.

7367
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,000
O-Okay, Akeno...

7368
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:07,090
That's right. Everyone wishes
to become closer to you, Issei.

7369
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:08,840
Asia...

7370
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:16,010
Big sister Rias, Xenovia, Irina,
Rossweisse, Kiba, and Gasper, too.

7371
00:08:16,010 --> 00:08:19,810
Everyone really loves you very much!

7372
00:08:19,810 --> 00:08:25,690
Do you distrust all of our words, Issei?

7373
00:08:25,690 --> 00:08:28,150
No.

7374
00:08:28,150 --> 00:08:32,320
Thanks. It must be true if
all of you are saying it.

7375
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:35,530
Asia, let me promise you again.

7376
00:08:35,530 --> 00:08:37,160
We'll always be together.

7377
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:39,830
Ten thousand years from now,
let's still be together.

7378
00:08:39,830 --> 00:08:41,910
I love you too, Asia.

7379
00:08:41,910 --> 00:08:47,420
Yes! Always together! I love you as well, Issei!

7380
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:50,880
Oh, my. I also wish to be with Issei forever.

7381
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:54,260
Me, too. I will always follow you, Issei.

7382
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:02,230
Irina! Come here a sec!

7383
00:09:02,230 --> 00:09:06,150
These things happen suddenly,
so you always have to be prepared!

7384
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:09,770
Irina! Come on! Your childhood
friend will be taken!

7385
00:09:09,770 --> 00:09:11,740
Actually, I'll be the one doing the taking!

7386
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:15,240
I am Lord Michael's ace!

7387
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:18,030
I'll be bearing the children
of a heavenly dragon!

7388
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:22,910
So, I will also join in on the fight for Issei!

7389
00:09:22,910 --> 00:09:24,290
Y-You guys!

7390
00:09:24,290 --> 00:09:28,420
I keep telling you guys to stop
with that explosive aggression!

7391
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:30,920
Issei is together with me!

7392
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:33,170
Why not, Asia? Just a bit.

7393
00:09:33,170 --> 00:09:36,760
That's right. Let's do this fairly! Asia! Xenovia!

7394
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:40,350
My, my. But isn't beating others
to the punch more thrilling?

7395
00:09:40,350 --> 00:09:41,810
Right, Koneko?

7396
00:09:41,810 --> 00:09:45,230
There is also the saying,
"First come first serve."

7397
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:52,400
There are a lot of things I don't
understand about girls, after all.

7398
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,530
But, thanks.

7399
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:55,610
Asia.

7400
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:56,740
Akeno.

7401
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:57,950
Koneko.

7402
00:09:57,950 --> 00:10:00,990
Xenovia. Irina.

7403
00:10:00,990 --> 00:10:04,450
I'll try to have more courage.

7404
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:07,960
I'll move forward with my own feelings.

7405
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:11,840
It may not be the answer that
President is looking for,

7406
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:15,970
but I will definitely convey these feelings.

7407
00:10:29,810 --> 00:10:33,440
This place is amazing up close.

7408
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:35,900
The floating city, Agreas.

7409
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:40,120
Actually, the Bael faction wanted
to have it in the Bael domain.

7410
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:45,080
The Duke Agares intervened between
the Great Satan and the Great King.

7411
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:48,210
And the game ended up being
held in the Agares domain.

7412
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:49,920
Is our match represented as the battle

7413
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:54,590
between the Great Satan Lucifer
and Great King Bael?

7414
00:10:54,590 --> 00:10:59,130
Well, there are many who look
at it that way. So, yeah.

7415
00:10:59,130 --> 00:11:05,180
It's so troublesome. We are just
doing it for our own ambitions.

7416
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:07,020
That's all you need to worry about.

7417
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:14,110
Even if you all lose, it will not affect
Sir Zechs' political standing.

7418
00:11:14,110 --> 00:11:20,280
The people backing the Great King
and Sairaorg will be happy though.

7419
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:23,240
The politicians behind Sairaorg?

7420
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,370
Yeah.

7421
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:38,460
I have been waiting for you.

7422
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:42,260
The match will begin at nightfall.

7423
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:46,890
So, until then, please wait in your
designated room next to the venue.

7424
00:12:01,950 --> 00:12:07,540
Sir Hades, the god who rules over
the dead of the netherworld.

7425
00:12:07,540 --> 00:12:11,290
I am surprised to see you,
who hates devils and fallen angels, here.

7426
00:12:13,460 --> 00:12:17,960
You crows have been squawking
around incessantly lately,

7427
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:20,760
so I have come to investigate.

7428
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,880
The Welsh Dragon.

7429
00:12:23,930 --> 00:12:31,350
I miss you and the Vanishing Dragon
running wild in the depths of hell.

7430
00:12:31,350 --> 00:12:32,890
Well, that is fine.

7431
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:35,610
Entertain me tonight.

7432
00:12:35,610 --> 00:12:38,110
Try your best not to die.

7433
00:12:38,110 --> 00:12:43,240
I have not come here tonight to take your souls.

7434
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:46,740
Putting the god of the netherworld aside,

7435
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:51,040
I'm surprised that Lord Zeus and
Lord Poseidon are attending, too.

7436
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,540
That's how much attention this game is getting.

7437
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,290
Excuse me.

7438
00:12:55,290 --> 00:12:57,920
Hey, I've come to watch.

7439
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:01,630
Lord Riser!

7440
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:03,170
Brother!

7441
00:13:04,380 --> 00:13:09,510
The game today is gathering the
attention of a professional game.

7442
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:15,440
If you can show off your strength here,
that itself has value.

7443
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:22,280
I am not as talented as Sona in battle
tactics and not as powerful as Sairaorg.

7444
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:24,860
I am just lucky to have
wonderful family members.

7445
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:31,240
Battle tactics and strength will
come with experience and effort.

7446
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:38,000
However, Rias, the talent to find and
gather skilled individuals is special.

7447
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:43,920
I believe your talent is what
has gathered your family here.

7448
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:48,050
However, many have gathered
here because of Issei.

7449
00:13:48,050 --> 00:13:54,480
You are the one who met the
Red Dragon Emperor. That is your fate.

7450
00:13:55,690 --> 00:14:00,230
Rias, these people here are
irreplaceable treasures for you.

7451
00:14:01,110 --> 00:14:03,030
Believe in their strength!

7452
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:08,490
Sorry for bothering you.

7453
00:14:09,530 --> 00:14:11,830
Oh, Red Dragon Emperor.

7454
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:16,040
I will never forget that blow from your fist.

7455
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,420
I want to return that favor.

7456
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:22,550
Hurry up and win this match and
come up to the professional league.

7457
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:27,180
Yes! Of course! I will definitely
beat you in a Game next time!

7458
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:30,600
And please take care of my dear sister.

7459
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,390
She is a straightforward one.

7460
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:34,350
If you make her cry, I will burn you up.

7461
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:36,480
Yeah, leave her to me!

7462
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:39,350
Th-That is none of your business!

7463
00:14:42,320 --> 00:14:43,980
Oh, that's right.

7464
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:47,950
Lord Sir Zechs told me he
wanted to see you a bit ago.

7465
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:49,070
Huh?

7466
00:14:50,570 --> 00:14:55,160
It seems your fans have sent you something.

7467
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:57,000
A movie or something?

7468
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,830
Yes. A message movie.

7469
00:14:59,830 --> 00:15:03,170
I love the Boob Dragon. Please win the Game.

7470
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:05,710
Please win!

7471
00:15:05,710 --> 00:15:06,260
--Boob Dragon! Please win! Poke aaaa!

7472
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:09,470
--Boobies! Boobies! Boobies!
--Boob Dragon! Please win! Poke aaaa!

7473
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:12,640
Take that! Boom!

7474
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:19,100
Boob Dragon, I can't be there for you,
but I'll cheer you on from home! Please win!

7475
00:15:19,100 --> 00:15:26,900
Today, children from all over the
underworld will be watching you.

7476
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:31,450
There are a lot of adult politics
involved in this match today.

7477
00:15:31,450 --> 00:15:37,830
It cannot be helped. That is why
I wanted to ask this of you.

7478
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:41,830
Will you please fight for the
dreams of these children?

7479
00:15:41,830 --> 00:15:46,920
Please protect the dreams of
these children, along with your own.

7480
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:52,720
I understand! I am the Boob Dragon, after all!

7481
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:05,900
I'm so nervous!

7482
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:11,200
It's all right. Just think
of everyone as pumpkins.

7483
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:15,200
Is it true that Irina is leading a cheer squad?

7484
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:21,410
Yeah. It seems she is cheering as a fan
in the special Boob Dragon seating.

7485
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:26,750
From the east gate, the Sairaorg Bael team!

7486
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:36,180
And from the west gate, the Rias Gremory team!

7487
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:42,140
Everyone, thank you for coming this far with me.

7488
00:16:42,140 --> 00:16:45,690
Now, let's go, my dear family.

7489
00:16:45,690 --> 00:16:46,900
Yes!

7490
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:14,130
All right, then. Good evening, everyone!

7491
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:18,510
I, Naud Gamigin, will be your
announcer for the evening!

7492
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:25,350
The arbiter for tonight's game
will be Rudiger Rosenkreutz!

7493
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:27,100
We also have a special guests today!

7494
00:17:27,100 --> 00:17:33,740
Azazel, the Governor-General of fallen angels,
has joined us as a special commentator!

7495
00:17:33,740 --> 00:17:38,820
On top of that, we also have the current
champion of the Rating Game,

7496
00:17:38,820 --> 00:17:41,290
Diehauser Belial!

7497
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:44,580
Now, about the rules of tonight's game.

7498
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:49,540
We shall have a Dice Figure Game,
a popular Rating Game variant!

7499
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:55,380
Will the two Kings please go
up to the special platform?

7500
00:17:55,380 --> 00:18:01,760
For those who do not know,
I shall explain the Dice Figure rules!

7501
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:05,310
They will be using a normal six-sided dice.

7502
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:11,820
Both kings will roll a dice and the resulting
total will decide the members of the match!

7503
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:14,940
For instance, if the number is eight,

7504
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:19,120
each side may send out members
that add up to the number.

7505
00:18:19,120 --> 00:18:23,910
The value of each player
depends on their evil piece.

7506
00:18:23,910 --> 00:18:25,620
Pawns are one point.

7507
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:27,420
Knights and Bishops are three points.

7508
00:18:27,420 --> 00:18:28,670
Rooks are five points.

7509
00:18:28,670 --> 00:18:31,630
And Queens are nine points.

7510
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:33,710
Multiple players may be chosen for the match.

7511
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:37,760
So in the case of eight points,
two knights may participate.

7512
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:45,520
Of course, you could also send out a
five-point Rook and three-point Knight, too!

7513
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:51,270
The number of pieces used for a
family member is taken into account.

7514
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:55,740
Since the Red Dragon Emperor,
Hyoudou Issei, has eight pawn pieces,

7515
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:58,360
he has a value of eight.

7516
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:04,120
However, you cannot send out the same
piece in a row, so please be careful.

7517
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:06,500
And, regarding the Kings.

7518
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:10,290
"The game will end if the King is defeated."

7519
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:17,880
Taking this into consideration, the review
board has decided their values.

7520
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:22,970
We shall now announce the value of each King!

7521
00:19:22,970 --> 00:19:26,060
Sairaorg Bael shall be worth 12 points!

7522
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:29,390
Rias Gremory shall be worth eight points!

7523
00:19:29,390 --> 00:19:33,190
Now, Sairaorg Bael may
have a higher point value,

7524
00:19:33,190 --> 00:19:39,530
but that also means he cannot
participate without a maximum roll!

7525
00:19:39,530 --> 00:19:42,030
Lastly, about phoenix tears.

7526
00:19:42,030 --> 00:19:47,750
Thanks to the Phoenix family,
each team will have one for the Game!

7527
00:19:47,750 --> 00:19:53,170
Meaning, we have to prepare ourselves
for defeating Sairaorg twice.

7528
00:19:53,170 --> 00:19:55,090
Yeah.

7529
00:19:55,090 --> 00:19:58,960
Now, let us finally start the game!

7530
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:07,060
We will now begin the Rating Game between
Sairaorg Bael and Rias Gremory!

7531
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:16,400
We shall now decide the first match.

7532
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:19,360
Kings, please pick up the dice.

7533
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:22,700
Shoot!

7534
00:20:26,490 --> 00:20:30,540
Player Rias has rolled a two!
Player Sairaorg has rolled a one!

7535
00:20:30,540 --> 00:20:32,250
Total of three!

7536
00:20:32,250 --> 00:20:34,960
Since the value of the
pawns on each side is high,

7537
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:39,210
only a Bishop or Knight may be chosen!

7538
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:43,880
Now, which family member will each
side choose for the first match?!

7539
00:20:43,880 --> 00:20:45,800
You have five minutes to plan.

7540
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:49,100
Please choose within that time frame.

7541
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:52,520
The first match...

7542
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:55,060
Who is going to participate?

7543
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:57,690
The five-minute time limit is almost up.

7544
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:03,240
Kiba! Don't lose on the first match!

7545
00:21:05,950 --> 00:21:07,620
I will win, of course.

7546
00:21:19,590 --> 00:21:24,760
The participants from each team
are now entering the battle field!

7547
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:28,010
The Gremory family has chosen
the Noble of God-like Speed!

7548
00:21:28,010 --> 00:21:29,470
The Knight of Princess Rias!

7549
00:21:29,470 --> 00:21:31,810
Kiba Yuto!

7550
00:21:50,830 --> 00:21:52,950
It's finally starting.

